\newlabel{fig:comparison}{{10}{12}{Side-by-side comparison of all three design variants during a ``Caution'' state. The same PERCLOS and EAR data is rendered as: an animated character expression change (left), a color-shifting status indicator (center), and full metric gauges with timeline (right). This demonstrates that HCAI principles of transparency and explainability can be achieved at multiple levels of interface complexity}{figure.caption.42}{}}
